  "title": "Bacon and Macaroni Salad",
  "description": "This recipe elevates classic macaroni salad with bacon. It's an easy, flavorful side, with savory and refreshing flavors. Perfect for BBQs or picnics.",
  "authors": [
    "readycooker"
  ],
